{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Begin Your Feeble Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your travels have led you to Makestone, a quaint village on the edge of something ancient. As a stranger here--unknown and untrusted--you must <strong>prove yourself</strong> to the local villagers. And when the dead begin to stir and whispers of a <strong>necromancer</strong> echo through the woods, you're the only one <strong>brave</strong> enough to <strong>act</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feeble Origins: Path of a Hero</i> is a <strong><i>hand-crafted</i></strong>, retro-inspired fantasy <strong>adventure</strong> that trades complexity for clarity. <strong>No rigid classes</strong>. No complex skill trees. Just <strong>quests</strong>, <strong>gear</strong>,  and solid gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/6a6111041ef08a80b7d778ac3b8f41a4.poster.avif?t=1768456220\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/6a6111041ef08a80b7d778ac3b8f41a4.webm?t=1768456220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/6a6111041ef08a80b7d778ac3b8f41a4.mp4?t=1768456220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore at Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Feeble Origins is <strong>non-linear</strong>, letting you choose your path with each quest. Venture further into the woods, <strong>descend</strong> into <strong>crypts</strong>, or brave the <strong>caverns</strong>. Each location holds its own <strong>secrets</strong>, <strong>puzzles</strong>, and fragments of a <strong>deeper story</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meaningful Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new <strong>weapon</strong> or <strong>armor</strong> piece is a <strong>meaningful upgrade</strong>, with each <strong>choice</strong> making a difference in gameplay style. Combat is straightforward but <strong>viscerally satisfying</strong>, with each swing, block, and <strong>dodge</strong> feeling earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/d1d77c517ac39a300f1c30a34901212a.poster.avif?t=1768456220\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/d1d77c517ac39a300f1c30a34901212a.webm?t=1768456220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/d1d77c517ac39a300f1c30a34901212a.mp4?t=1768456220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each <strong>quest</strong>, you'll uncover pieces of a growing <strong>mystery</strong>: Why are the <strong>dead rising</strong>? Who is behind it? And what <i>lies</i> <strong>beneath</strong> Makestone Village?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nostalgia, Reimagined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeble Origins is built to evoke the warmth of <strong>retro</strong> RPGs--not through pixel-perfect imitation--but through <strong>tone</strong>, pacing, and <strong>simplicity</strong>. It's a game that respects your time, <strong>rewards</strong> your curiosity, and invites you to settle into its rhythm.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/8efd3b7ce06f796cca067e12d2738de4cf522832.jpg"},{"name":"Slay The Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/030e0eca8521ab819102dc991cae3ef0a06e78a6.jpg"},{"name":"Match Maker","path":"https://